      "writtenOn": "2026-05-08T20:07:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I made the necessary changes. The only thing I couldn\u0027t figure out is that I thought an `OutOfMemory` error would be appropriate, but when I did this, the `ASSERT_DEVICE_ERROR` on the queue.submit would fail with `\"While handling unexpected error type OutOfMemory when allowed errors are (Validation|DeviceLost)\"`. So I went with a validation error.\n\nI suspect that I need to do some `ConsumedError` stuff to handle this, or something.",
      "parentUuid": "a3ce9aee_e7a5b781",
      "revId": "102ae90bb3503d06e2fd36c7a3f043df4a690680",
