      "writtenOn": "2026-05-11T08:25:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is an unrecoverable error that should produce a device loss, so `DAWN_INTERNAL_ERROR` would be the appropriate error here IMHO.\n\nIn the test we will need to check that this causes a loss on D3D12, I was thinking DeviceLostTests had some utility that we could copy here but it doesn\u0027t. It seems that we need to add an `EXPECT_DEVICE_LOSS` macro and machinery in DawnTest. Feel free to split in another CL (and just have a TODO here) since this a larger change than expected.",
      "parentUuid": "049a72e1_aa8516ab",
